sentences.text:
(By Smt. Waheeda M.M, Hcgp For R-1;
 V/O Dt:06/06/2025 Notice To R-2 Is Hled Sufficient)
Krishna R vs State Of Karnataka on 10 June, 2025

The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Special Case (POCSO) No.2/2024 pending before the Court of Special, II Addl. District and Sessions Judge, Chitradurga, arising out of Crime No.186/2023 registered by Imangala Police Station, Chitradurga, for the offences punishable under Sections 363 and 376 of IPC, Section 4 of the POCSO Act, 2012 and Section 9 of the Prohibition of Child Marriage Act (Karnataka Amendment) Act, 2016, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute a personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
NC: 2025:KHC:19856 HC-KAR e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
